OL,3,AYou Can See Everything documentary
OL,4,Astuns with huge box office debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FA three-hour documentary on the tech
OL,7,Ffraudster Elizabeth Holmes has raked in
OL,8,Fa whopping $15 million (#11.25m) on its
OL,9,Fbox office debut, despite a limited run
OL,10,Fat 855 screens across the US and
OL,11,FCanada.
OL,13,FThe eagerly anticipated film, You Can
OL,14,FSee Everything, finds Holmes letting
OL,15,Ffilmmakers into her California home in
OL,16,F2023, during the month before she began
OL,17,Fan 11-year prison sentence.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
